      "uid": "zhcn:e2628c688c5c07f59575a17f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "休息日，我准备来电影院看看电影——\r\n却突然在前厅遇见了目白多伯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd9cdaf89c81aaf2bb7a132435426d5d118f4963b559b057cd933634de21b697",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
